DLC_Dat["Fallen Banners"]={}
DLC_Dat["Fallen Banners"].name="Fallen Banners"
DLC_Dat["Fallen Banners"].dat={
4109, -- Exiled Redoubt Vanquisher,  Defeat Executioner Jerensi, Prime Sorcerer Vandorallen, and the Squall of Retribution in Exiled Redoubt.
4110, -- Exiled Redoubt Conqueror,  Defeat Executioner Jerensi, Prime Sorcerer Vandorallen, and the Squall of Retribution in Veteran Exiled Redoubt.
4111, -- Squall Silencer,  Defeat the Squall of Retribution after raising the Challenge Banner in Veteran Exiled Redoubt.
4112, -- Swift Hand of Justice,  Defeat all encounters in addition to Executioner Jerensi, Prime Sorcerer Vandorallen, and the Squall of Retribution within 25 minutes of entering Veteran Exiled Redoubt. Your timer starts upon engaging the first enemies.
4113, -- Leave No Ghosts,  Defeat all encounters in addition to Executioner Jerensi, Prime Sorcerer Vandorallen, and the Squall of Retribution in Veteran Exiled Redoubt without suffering a group member death.
4114, -- Exiled Redoubt Challenger,  Complete the listed achievements for Veteran Exiled Redoubt.
4115, -- Revenge Breaker,  Defeat all encounters in addition to Executioner Jerensi, Prime Sorcerer Vandorallen, and the Squall of Retribution after placing the Challenge Banners in Veteran Exiled Redoubt within 25 minutes without suffering a group member death. Your timer starts when you engage the first group of enemies.
4116, -- Evading Execution,  Defeat Executioner Jerensi without being hit by her spike traps in Veteran Exiled Redoubt.
4117, -- Unfragmented,  During the battle with the Squall of Retribution pick up a Fire, Ice, or Shock Orb before they develop into Fiery Eruption, Freezing Shard, or Lightning Blast and defeat the Squall of Retribution in Exiled Redoubt.
4120, -- Exposed to the Elements,  In a full 4-player group, after raising the Challenge Banner defeat the Squall of Retribution only after each member of your group has picked up one of every color of elemental orb in Veteran Exiled Redoubt.
4121, -- Return to Rest,  In one expedition into the Exiled Redoubt defeat Guard Captain Paratius, Docent Domitius, and Eliana Albus before defeating the Squall of Retribution.
4122, -- Forcibly Pardoned,  Defeat Executioner Jerensi after raising the Challenge Banner in Veteran Exiled Redoubt.
4123, -- Arrogance's Remedy,  Defeat Prime Sorcerer Vandorallen after raising the Challenge Banner in Veteran Exiled Redoubt.
4125, -- Life's for the Living,  Defeat Executioner Jerensi, Prime Sorcerer Vandorallen, and the Squall of Retribution after raising the Challenge Banner and without gaining the benefits from completing optional content in Veteran Exiled Redoubt.
4128, -- Lep Seclusa Vanquisher,  Defeat Garvin the Tracker, Noriwen, and Orpheon the Tactician in Lep Seclusa.
4129, -- Lep Seclusa Conqueror,  Defeat Garvin the Tracker, Noriwen, and Orpheon the Tactician in Veteran Lep Seclusa.
4131, -- Quick Deliverance,  Defeat all encounters including Garvin the Tracker, Noriwen, and Orpheon the Tactician within 30 minutes of entering Veteran Lep Seclusa. Your timer starts upon engaging the first enemies.
4132, -- Strike True,  Defeat all encounters including Garvin the Tracker, Noriwen, and Orpheon the Tactician in Veteran Lep Seclusa without suffering a group member death.
4133, -- Lep Seclusa Challenger,  Complete the listed achievements for Veteran Lep Seclusa.
4134, -- Sic Semper,  Defeat all encounters in addition to Garvin the Tracker, Noriwen, and Orpheon the Tactician after raising the Challenge Banner in Veteran Lep Seclusa within 30 minutes without suffering a group member death. Your timer starts upon engaging the first enemies.
4136, -- Nipped in the Bud,  Defeat Garvin the Tracker without allowing him to place any traps in Veteran Lep Seclusa.
4137, -- Siege Survivor,  Defeat Noriwen while under siege in Lep Seclusa.
4138, -- Unburnt and Unscathed,  Defeat Noriwen without any player getting hit by a Fire Line Blast from a Gryphon Bomber in Veteran Lep Seclusa.
4140, -- Shielded Insurrection,  Defeat Orpheon the Tactician without any player being hit by an unblocked Arcane Void attack in Veteran Lep Seclusa.
4141, -- Erase the Tracks,  Defeat Garvin the Tracker after raising the Challenge Banner in Veteran Lep Seclusa.
4142, -- Stay Grounded,  Defeat Noriwen after raising the Challenge Banner in Veteran Lep Seclusa.
4143, -- Slowed Not Stopped,  Defeat Orpheon the Tactician after being afflicted by Slow Descent and having your resources reduced to 25% or less in Veteran Lep Seclusa.
4144, -- Tactical Recklessness,  Complete Lep Seclusa without being struck by siege, leaving Siege Master Malthoras alive.
4146, -- Fallen Banners Delver,  Complete both Exiled Redoubt and Lep Seclusa on Veteran.
4147, -- Fallen Banners Scout,  Complete both Exiled Redoubt and Lep Seclusa on Normal.
4253, -- Thorough Rescuer,  Find and speak with all the surviving Hel Netu throughout Lep Seclusa prior to defeating Orpheon the Tactician.
4124, -- Haunt Seeker,  Complete optional content in Exiled Redoubt by defeating Guard Captain Paratius, Docent Domitius, and Eliana Albus.
4130, -- Dethroned Once More,  Defeat Orpheon the Tactician after raising the Challenge Banner in Veteran Lep Seclusa.
4296, -- Lep Seclusa Champion,  Complete the listed achievements in Lep Seclusa.
4295, -- Exiled Redoubt Champion,  Complete the listed achievements in Exiled Redoubt.
4250, -- Twice Struck,  During the fight with Lewin Frey, be hit by Charged Strike while you are under the effects of Conduit in Lep Seclusa.
4252, -- Unsinged Boots,  Defeat Flamedancer Ajim-Rei without any party member being burned by Molting Flames in Lep Seclusa.
